"Changing it will retokenize the visible text and migrate all stored associations in the project. If the migration does not match the text, project associations can be lost or corrupted.\n"
"\n"
"Choose one of the options below:\n"
"Yes: clear all project associations before changing the tokenizer.\n"
"No: migrate all project associations and change the tokenizer.\n"
"Cancel: keep the current tokenizer version."
